      "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "links": [5]}],
      "title": "2. Confused > polite smile > awkward > flower pop",
      "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"},
      "widgets_values": ["One continuous four-second photorealistic shot, vertical 9:16, natural speed. Use the supplied image as the first frame. Preserve the woman's facial identity, green shirt, crossed arms, hairstyle, jewelry and unfinished room.\n\nKeep the original framing, stationary camera, steady focus and soft daylight. Her head stays in its starting position, with her gaze directed toward the person off-screen to screen-right.\n\nShe initially looks mildly confused, with a slight tension in her eyebrows. A tiny, polite closed-mouth smile briefly appears, then gently fades into an awkward, uncertain expression. Keep these facial changes small and natural. Her arms remain crossed and her hands stay still.\n\nHer hair remain free during this reaction. One fully opened red hibiscus tucked behind her visible ear on screen-left. It appears instantly in place and stays attached.\n\nShe holds the awkward expression. Preserve her face and head position throughout. Gentle breathing, silent performance, no cuts or added text."]
    },
